---
import { i18n } from '../../i18n';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import BaseHead from '../../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import Icon from '../../components/Icon.astro';
import ProductSearch from '../../assets/portofolio/custom-order-system-beranda.png';
import NewArrivals from '../../assets/portofolio/custom-order-system-barang-baru-masuk.png';

const { lang, t, href } = i18n(Astro.url.pathname);---
<!doctype html>
<html lang={lang}>
 <head>
  <BaseHead title={t("Order System — A project by Adi")} description={t("A wholesale phone spare-parts ordering platform for Libra Jaya, with model-based product search, account-specific pricing, bulk ordering, and order history.")} image={ProductSearch}/>
 </head>
 <body>
  <Header/>
  <main id="main" class="container">
   <section class="case-intro">
    <a href={href("/#work")} class="back-link"><Icon name="arrow-left" size={15}/> {t("Selected work")}</a>
    <div class="eyebrow">{t("Portfolio / Wholesale commerce / Libra Jaya")}</div>
    <h1>Order System<span>.</span></h1>
    <p class="case-subtitle">{t("Find the right part.")}<br/><span>{t("Keep the order moving.")}</span></p>
    <div class="case-meta">
     <div><span>{t("Project")}</span><strong>{t("Wholesale spare-parts ordering")}</strong></div>
     <div><span>{t("Focus")}</span><strong>{t("Product discovery & bulk purchasing")}</strong></div>
     <div><span>{t("Built with")}</span><strong>Laravel · MySQL · Bootstrap · Playwright</strong></div>
    </div>
   </section>
   <figure class="case-image search-image">
    <div class="image-toolbar"><span>ORDER SYSTEM / LIBRA JAYA</span><span>{t("01 / PRODUCT SEARCH")}</span></div>
    <Image src={ProductSearch} alt={t("Libra Jaya product search showing phone-model query Y21, a category filter, guest pricing information, and quantity fields for phone spare parts")} width={1400} loading="eager"/>
    <figcaption>{t("Search starts with the phone model, with product names, prices, and quantities presented together.")}</figcaption>
   </figure>
   <section class="case-section">
    <div><div class="eyebrow"><span class="number">01</span> {t("The context")}</div><h2>{t("Built around")}<br/>{t("the wholesale order.")}</h2></div>
    <div class="prose">
     <p>{t("A phone spare-parts catalog has many closely related products: similar model names, different components, and multiple variants. Wholesale customers also need to choose quantities across several products and see the pricing assigned to their account.")}</p>
     <p>{t("Order System brings those tasks into a custom web platform for Libra Jaya. Customers can search by phone model, narrow the catalog by category, explore new arrivals, and build an order from the product listing.")}</p>
    </div>
   </section>
   <section class="case-section">
    <div><div class="eyebrow"><span class="number">02</span> {t("The experience")}</div><h2>{t("Search with context.")}<br/>{t("Order in one flow.")}</h2></div>
    <div class="decisions">
     <div><span>01</span><div><h3>{t("Start with the model.")}</h3><p>{t("The search interface uses familiar phone-model examples and category filters. Product rows keep model and variant names visible so customers can distinguish similar parts.")}</p></div></div>
     <div><span>02</span><div><h3>{t("Make pricing explicit.")}</h3><p>{t("Guests see a notice explaining that displayed prices are the pre-login prices. Signed-in customers see prices based on their assigned pricing category.")}</p></div></div>
     <div><span>03</span><div><h3>{t("Select several products together.")}</h3><p>{t("Quantity inputs sit alongside the products. Customers can select several items and add them to the cart in one action, with product quantity multiples handled by the backend.")}</p></div></div>
    </div>
   </section>
   <figure class="case-image arrivals-image">
    <div class="image-toolbar"><span>ORDER SYSTEM / LIBRA JAYA</span><span>{t("02 / NEW ARRIVALS")}</span></div>
    <Image src={NewArrivals} alt={t("Libra Jaya new-arrivals listing with phone-model search instructions, category filtering, prices, and product quantity inputs")} width={1400}/>
    <figcaption>{t("New arrivals use the same search and quantity-entry pattern as the main catalog.")}</figcaption>
   </figure>
   <section class="case-section">
    <div><div class="eyebrow"><span class="number">03</span> {t("Under the surface")}</div><h2>{t("The details")}<br/>{t("behind the cart.")}</h2></div>
    <div class="prose">
     <p>{t("Laravel serves the catalog, account pricing, cart actions, and order history. Blade templates, Bootstrap, and JavaScript connect the listing interface to those backend rules.")}</p>
     <p>{t("The bulk-order flow handles products already in the cart, quantity multiples, and repeated submissions. Order history shows unit prices, line subtotals, and a total for the selected date range.")}</p>
     <p>{t("The project includes browser-test coverage for search, bulk ordering, draft restoration, failure recovery, and order history. These flows give the implementation concrete behaviors to check as it evolves.")}</p>
     <div class="stack"><span class="pill">Laravel</span><span class="pill">MySQL</span><span class="pill">Blade</span><span class="pill">Bootstrap</span><span class="pill">JavaScript</span><span class="pill">Playwright</span><span class="pill">{t("Bulk ordering")}</span></div>
    </div>
   </section>
   <section class="flow-section">
    <div class="eyebrow">{t("From discovery to a reviewable order")}</div>
    <div class="flow">
     <div><span>{t("DISCOVER")}</span><h3>{t("Find the model.")}<br/>{t("Compare the parts.")}</h3><p>{t("Search & category filtering")}</p></div>
     <span class="flow-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
     <div><span>{t("BUILD THE CART")}</span><h3>{t("Set quantities.")}<br/>{t("Add items together.")}</h3><p>{t("Customer pricing & quantity rules")}</p></div>
     <span class="flow-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
     <div><span>{t("REVIEW")}</span><h3>{t("Check the items.")}<br/>{t("See the totals.")}</h3><p>{t("Cart & order history")}</p></div>
    </div>
   </section>
   <section class="case-section next-questions">
    <div><div class="eyebrow"><span class="number">04</span> {t("The craft")}</div><h2>{t("A familiar pattern,")}<br/>{t("across the catalog.")}</h2></div>
    <div class="prose"><p>{t("The homepage search, category pages, and new-arrivals listing share the same core interaction: find a product, enter a quantity, and continue the order. A consistent pattern helps the customer carry the task across different ways of browsing.")}</p><p>{t("Account-specific prices, product quantity multiples, and date-scoped totals make the business rules visible where customers use them: choosing parts, building the cart, and reviewing an order.")}</p></div>
   </section>
   <div class="case-end"><a href={href("/#work")} class="text-link"><Icon name="arrow-left" size={16}/> {t("Back to the portfolio")}</a><a href={href("/work/optical-management-system/")} class="text-link">{t("Explore Optical Management System")} <Icon name="arrow-up-right" size={16}/></a></div>
  </main>
  <Footer/>
 </body>
</html>
<style>
 .case-intro{padding:45px 0 40px}.back-link{display:inline-flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:44px}.back-link:hover{color:var(--accent)}.case-intro .eyebrow{font-size:10px;color:var(--accent)}h1{font-size:clamp(48px,7vw,94px);margin-top:22px}h1>span{color:var(--accent)}.case-subtitle{font:500 38px/1.25 var(--font-display);letter-spacing:-.04em;color:var(--ink);margin-top:25px}.case-subtitle span{color:var(--muted)}.case-meta{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.4fr 1fr;gap:30px;margin-top:45px;padding-top:25px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.case-meta>div{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:7px}.case-meta span{font-size:9px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--muted)}.case-meta strong{font-size:12px;font-weight:500}.case-image{margin:0;padding:30px;background:#dbe5df;border-radius:4px;color:#24463e}.image-toolbar{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font:8px var(--font-display);letter-spacing:.1em;margin-bottom:20px}.case-image img{border-radius:4px;box-shadow:0 10px 30px #24463e10;width:100%}.case-image figcaption{font-size:10px;margin-top:20px;color:#486457}.case-section{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.3fr;gap:90px;padding-block:70px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.case-section h2{font-size:35px;margin-top:23px;line-height:1.2}.case-section .eyebrow{font-size:10px}.case-section .prose{font-size:16px}.evidence-note{font-size:12px;background:var(--surface);padding:16px 20px;border-left:2px solid var(--line)}.decisions{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:30px}.decisions>div{display:flex;align-items:start;gap:20px}.decisions>div>span{font:10px var(--font-display);color:var(--accent);padding-top:7px}.decisions h3{font-size:23px;margin-bottom:12px}.decisions p{font-size:14px;line-height:1.8}.booking-image{margin-top:65px;background:#e1e5e9;color:#586575}.booking-image figcaption{color:#586575}.stack{display:flex;gap:7px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:25px}.stack .pill{font-size:10px}.flow-section{padding:35px;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);margin-top:60px}.flow-section>.eyebrow{font-size:10px;color:var(--muted)}.flow{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;margin-top:30px}.flow>div>span{font-size:8px;color:var(--accent);letter-spacing:.08em}.flow h3{font-size:23px;line-height:1.3;margin-block:12px}.flow p{font-size:10px}.flow-arrow{font-size:24px;color:var(--muted)}.next-questions{border-bottom:0}.prose .text-link{font-size:11px;text-decoration:none}.case-end{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:60px;padding-top:20px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.case-end .text-link{font-size:11px}
 @media(max-width:900px){.case-section{gap:40px}.case-section h2{font-size:30px}.case-meta{gap:20px}.flow h3{font-size:20px}.flow{gap:12px}.flow-section{padding:25px}}
 @media(max-width:650px){.case-intro{padding-top:30px}.case-subtitle{font-size:28px}.case-meta{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:20px}.case-image{padding:15px}.image-toolbar{font-size:6px;gap:15px}.case-image figcaption{font-size:9px}.case-section{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:25px;padding-block:45px}.case-section h2{font-size:31px}.flow{flex-direction:column;align-items:start;gap:20px}.flow-arrow{transform:rotate(90deg);margin-left:35px}.flow>div{width:100%;padding:5px 0}.flow h3 br{display:none}.flow h3{font-size:23px}.flow h3 br::after{content:' '}.flow-section{margin-top:35px}.case-end{gap:25px;flex-wrap:wrap}.booking-image{margin-top:40px}}

 .search-image{background:#e7e1d6;color:#65573f}.search-image figcaption{color:#65573f}.arrivals-image{margin-top:65px;background:#dbe5df}.flow>div{min-width:0}.flow h3{font-size:21px}
 @media(max-width:650px){.arrivals-image{margin-top:40px}.flow h3{font-size:23px}.flow h3 br{display:initial}.case-intro .eyebrow{font-size:9px}}
</style>
